  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Bring a medium saucepan of water to the boil for the noodles. Shred the carrots using a julienne peeler or coarsely grate with a box grater. Peel and thinly slice the cucumber (see Make it yours).",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218495/photos/large/410567_1-8158fcf9a89688f5d7cbbb3a5f56de86.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pickle veg: Combine 3 tsp white vinegar and 1 tsp sugar in a large bowl. Add the carrot and cucumber and toss to coat. Set aside to pickle, tossing occasionally, until needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218500/photos/large/410567_2-850f5fbc8cd6dd7c50e02cbe4a9f9753.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook mushroom meat: Heat 2 tsp vegetable oil in a medium frypan over high heat. Cook the mushroom meat, breaking up the lumps with a spoon, for 3-4 mins until starting to brown. Add the pho seasoning, 2 tsp soy sauce and 125ml (½ cup) water and cook, stirring, for 30 secs or until mostly reduced. Remove the pan from the heat. Taste, then season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218505/photos/large/410567_3-2c58eb29d3998115e8ac9b804a063ea5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook noodles: Meanwhile, cook the noodles in the pan of boiling water for 7-8 mins until tender. Drain, then rinse under cold water to prevent the noodles from sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218507/photos/large/410567_4-67748553711fa9d215a8955141720ff9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Combine the sweet chilli sauce and half the peanuts in a bowl. Divide the noodles, mushroom meat mixture and pickled veg among bowls. Drizzle with the peanut-chilli sauce and remaining pickling liquid, if desired. Scatter with the remaining peanuts and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218510/photos/large/410567_5-5ee6b0c70f3ef80250ea13bfc891742f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: We have peeled the cucumber to help absorb more of the pickling liquid. Feel free to keep the skin on, if you prefer.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218512/photos/large/410567_6-6008943387a372362a097cc2b5e7fe2e.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
